<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_pruned_first">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">
<span id="id1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-8.0pt;"><img src="2504.20995v1/figures/logo.png" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:28/28;" width="28" height="28" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span>
<span id="id2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0D68AB;">Tes<span id="id2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0B4EA3;">ser<span id="id2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#08349A;">Act</span></span></span>: Learning 4D Embodied World Models

</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
